        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5051SQU, Modern Brass Square Knobset with Neos Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking for a modern knobset with a little edge, the Square Knob with Neos Rose is for you. It is a chic paring of square knob and tapered rectangular rosette that makes this contemporary door knob exactly what you need to update your home. The Modern Brass Square Knobset with Neos Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Neos Rose with Square Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Square Knob and Neos Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
