                "title": "Square Knob with Neos Rose",
                "description": "If you are looking for a modern knobset with a little edge, the Square Knob with Neos Rose is for you. It is a chic paring of square knob and tapered rectangular rosette that makes this contemporary door knob exactly what you need to update your home. The Modern Brass Square Knobset with Neos Rosette will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions.",
